    "description": "Shown to a Customer when a Cook rejects their Order. Actionable: names what to do next. Customer-directed verbs (جرب / اطلب; EN Try / order) stay ungendered in both branches — Kafoo stores no form of address for Customers; wiring those verbs to cookForm would be wrong. Only the Cook-describing clause differs by cookForm.",
